# LeakSanitizer suppressions for the libFuzzer harnesses (fuzz workflow,
# Linux). Keep each entry to one known one-time allocation so per-input
# leaks still fail the run.
#
# rv-fuzz-normalize: the private global `gate` compiles the day-one packs
# once (NSRegularExpression via ICUPatternEngine.compile) and lives for the
# whole process. Matches only stacks through that global's initializer.
leak:rv_fuzz_normalize4gate
